                    616.0,
                    1401.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Sensor-free contact-force control is a directly relevant line. Jolaei et al. [14] regulate the contact force of a tendon-driven ablation catheter without a force sensor via position control plus a displacement-based viscoelastic contact model.",
